WEBVTT

1
00:00:07.534 --> 00:00:15.995
"Wow! Your birthday cake is beautiful," said Bob.

2
00:00:15.996 --> 00:00:19.436
"It has so many layers!

3
00:00:19.437 --> 00:00:21.625
Who made it?"

4
00:00:21.626 --> 00:00:25.839
"Well," I said.

5
00:00:25.840 --> 00:00:28.778
"A farmer grew the wheat.

6
00:00:28.779 --> 00:00:34.680
A miller changed the wheat into flour.

7
00:00:34.681 --> 00:00:38.878
A chicken laid the eggs.

8
00:00:38.879 --> 00:00:41.799
And a cow gave the milk.

9
00:00:41.800 --> 00:00:45.821
So they helped make my cake.

10
00:00:45.822 --> 00:00:51.480
A truck driver delivered the flour, eggs, and milk.

11
00:00:51.481 --> 00:00:57.276
A clerk sold them to my mother.

12
00:00:57.277 --> 00:01:00.959
My mother brought them home.

13
00:01:00.960 --> 00:01:04.411
So they helped too.

14
00:01:04.412 --> 00:01:16.873
My grandmother put everything into a bowl.

15
00:01:16.874 --> 00:01:20.375
She mixed the flour, eggs, and milk.

16
00:01:20.376 --> 00:01:23.828
Then she poured it into a baking pan.

17
00:01:23.829 --> 00:01:28.005
My sister put the pan into the oven.

18
00:01:28.006 --> 00:01:32.712
After thirty minutes she took it out.

19
00:01:32.713 --> 00:01:36.806
So they also helped.

20
00:01:36.807 --> 00:01:39.732
Then I put the icing on the cake.

21
00:01:39.733 --> 00:01:43.220
So I helped too.

22
00:01:43.221 --> 00:01:48.364
We all helped make it.

23
00:01:48.365 --> 00:01:51.111
"Wow!" said Bob.

24
00:01:51.112 --> 00:01:54.584
"Many people helped make your cake.

25
00:01:54.585 --> 00:01:57.743
But it's not finished yet!"

26
00:01:57.744 --> 00:02:00.654
"What do you mean?" I asked.

27
00:02:00.655 --> 00:02:03.417
"It looks finished to me."

28
00:02:03.418 --> 00:02:07.875
"It doesn't have candles!" said Bob.

29
00:02:07.876 --> 00:02:09.606
"I'll put some on.

30
00:02:09.607 --> 00:02:15.557
I helped too!

31
00:02:15.558 --> 00:02:23.208
Happy Birthday!"
